        "id": 1903985
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-07T20:29:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am thinking that externalizing the script into a file is cleaner, but not sure if that is the consensus (looking at other places in our code base, inlined template codes etc seems common - but then those are not user-facing features).\n\nAdding support for expressions was something I originally had and then removed because all existing plugins involved conditions more complex than to fit in simple expressions. But let me know if you\u0027d prefer to keep it, e.g. at least the unit tests (derived_test.go) will look a bit better.",
      "parentUuid": "41ce3944_ae80313c",
      "revId": "9e6fbf1a81122d8f237679253a6303e91c155594",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
